	)
	(text "BALANCE - BQ76907 monitor + host-controlled balancing (~20mA via 100R cell resistors)\nFirmware: Vcell Mode 4/3/2 per detected pack, and close the photo-MOS shorts:\n   4S: K1 off, K2 off   |   3S: K1 ON, K2 off   |   2S: K1 ON, K2 ON   (1S: no balance)\nA wrongly-closed switch only loads a cell through 2x100R (~20mA) so imo should be fine"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.336 183.388 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "16554cc8-3a7a-4e12-9010-21657ebb8e31")
	)
	(text "charger module: MP2760 buck-boost, 1-4S, up to 6A (set by firmware over I2C)\nPort I2C addresses: MP2760 0x69, BQ76907 0x08 (both behind TCA9548A mux ch.)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1769f123-67a9-49ab-ac3b-ee6b5f084abd")
